      "content": "Your security team should be alert to groups that appear overly intoxicated or exhibiting aggressive behavior early on. Keep an eye out for large groups loitering for extended periods, especially if they seem to be actively disruptive or making excessive noise. Also, watch for individuals who appear to be conducting private business or confrontations in public areas, as this can quickly escalate. Training your team to observe subtly is key to proactive, professional management.",
